# Release metadata

Follow **Completing work** in `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/release-metadata/SKILL.md`.

Every change merged to `main` includes `VERSION`, `resources/data/releases.json`, `resources/data/module-runtime-contract.json` (`application_version`), and the version-pinned tests from `php artisan myapes:changelog-prepare` in the same pull request. Replace every `TODO:` in the new head record. Validate with `php artisan myapes:changelog-validate --base-ref=origin/main`.

Patch for a compatible fix. Minor for a backward-compatible capability. Pre-1.0 breaking changes are documented and bump minor.
